    "message": "fix(ci): wire ALERT-01 regression gate (R19) \u2014 self-sufficient npm script + CI step\n\nImplements R19_CI_WIRING_PROPOSAL_v2_amended.patch (review-only proposal from\nvixor-deliverables PR #11 package):\n\n- bot-worker/package.json: add 'regression' script that is self-sufficient from\n  a clean tree (builds .smoke via tsc -p tests/smoke.tsconfig.json before running\n  tests/alert01-regression.cjs) \u2014 fixes N-1 finding (MODULE_NOT_FOUND when\n  invoked standalone without a prior 'npm test' build).\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: add 'ALERT01 regression (R1-R19)' step to the\n  bot-worker job after smoke tests.\n\nNo production logic changed; no tests removed or weakened; existing\ntypecheck/smoke steps untouched. R19/R21-01/R22-01 remediation (review-only,\nnot merged by this commit's author).",
